hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19208","Abu al-Nadr narrated to us, Shayban narrated to us from Ziyad ibn Ilaqah from Arfajah ibn Shurayh al-Aslami who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: There will be discords after me, and he raised his hands. Whoever you see dividing the community of Muhammad while they are united, then kill him, whoever he may be among the people."
"19209","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us from Ziyad ibn Ilaqah, he said: I heard Arfajah who said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: There will be discords. Whoever intends to divide the affair of this ummah while it is united, then strike him with the sword, whoever he may be."
